sequenceDiagram
    participant View as AgenticAiView
    participant CM as ContextManager
    participant Idx as Indexer
    participant Chk as Treesitter Chunker
    participant Emb as Embedder (Ollama/Transformers)
    participant FS as FileSystem
    participant Cache as Disk Cache

    Note over View,Cache: PHASE 1: CREATE INDEXER
    View->>CM: createIndexer(provider, model)
    CM->>Idx: Indexer.create({ provider, model })
    Idx->>Emb: loadEmbedder(opts)
    Emb->>Emb: initialize() + getDimensions()
    Emb-->>Idx: Embedder ready
    Idx->>Chk: loadChunker(opts)
    Chk-->>Idx: Chunker ready
    Idx-->>CM: Indexer instance (EventEmitter)
    CM-->>View: indexer reference

    View->>Idx: on('progress', handler)
    View->>Idx: on('error', handler)

    Note over View,Cache: PHASE 2: INDEX PROJECT
    View->>CM: indexCurrentProject({ force, provider, model })
    CM->>Idx: index({ projectPath, cacheDir, include, exclude })

    Note over Idx: Phase: scan
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'scan', status: 'start' })
    Idx->>FS: fast-glob(include, { ignore: exclude })
    FS-->>Idx: Array of file paths
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'scan', status: 'complete' })

    Note over Idx: Phase: chunk
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'chunk', status: 'start' })
    loop For each file
        Idx->>FS: readFile(filePath, 'utf-8')
        FS-->>Idx: File content
        Idx->>Chk: parseCodeFile(file, content)
        Chk->>Chk: AST parse → extract functions/classes/methods
        Chk-->>Idx: Code chunks with metadata
        Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'chunk', status: 'progress' })
    end
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'chunk', status: 'complete' })

    Note over Idx: Phase: embed
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'embed', status: 'start' })
    Idx->>Emb: generateEmbeddings(texts) [concurrency: 5]
    loop Worker pool (5 concurrent)
        Emb->>Emb: embed(text)
        Emb-->>Idx: Vector embedding
        Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'embed', status: 'progress' })
    end
    Idx->>Idx: Filter failed embeddings (skip, don't zero-fill)
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'embed', status: 'complete' })

    Note over Idx: Phase: cache
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'cache', status: 'start' })
    Idx->>Cache: writeToCache → embeddings_<projectName>.json
    Cache-->>Idx: File saved
    Idx->>Idx: emit('progress', { phase: 'cache', status: 'complete' })

    Note over Idx: Done
    Idx->>Idx: emit('done', IndexResult)
    Idx-->>CM: IndexResult { embedFile, dimensions, model, timestamp }
    CM-->>View: Indexing complete
    View->>Idx: removeListener('progress')
    View->>Idx: removeListener('error')
